WEBVTT

00:00:00.790 --> 00:00:03.680
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.520
I'll count to three!

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:10.660
Surrender or duel.  Decide.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.370
The Ignis may be hiding there.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.250
This is a dangerous task.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.000
I can only rely on you.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.380
You seemed worried about 
the hunter, Blood Shepherd.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:25.940
He's trouble.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.180
Once he's after you, he won't let you escape.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.280
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Capture Drone!

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:36.550
Your AI said your set card couldn't activate!

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:40.520
Who decided that an AI's info is accurate?

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:44.190
You made the AI tell a lie?

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.990
Playmaker, you can't defeat me.

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:10.330
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:17.140
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:24.420
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:30.990
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:37.760
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:45.000
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:51.680
I want to share your pain

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.800
Blood Shepherd is quite troublesome.

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:36.540
Battledrone General's effect activates!

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:42.510
Once per turn, I Special Summon a Drone 
from the graveyard next to its link!

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.200
Come, Drone Pawn!

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:52.480
From my hand, I activate the 
Equip Spell, Drone Launcher Unit.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.450
I equip it on Battledrone General!

00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:01.930
The monster equipped with Drone Launcher 
Unit isn't affected by your monster's effects.

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:05.140
He equipped an awesome weapon!

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:06.910
Is he a weapon otaku?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.910
A soldier gains power by receiving equipment,

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:13.700
weapons and vehicles from excellent superior officers.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:14.540
He's serious.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.260
Drone Launcher Unit's effect.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:22.010
For every Link Marker on the 
field, you take 100 damage.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.280
Seriously?

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:27.720
Umm...  The number of Link Markers is... six!

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:29.050
It's seven!

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:30.970
Can't you even count?

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:35.900
Who decided that my info is accurate?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:36.960
Be quiet!

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:37.700
Okay.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.940
I set one card.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.910
My army's formation is complete.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.880
But ours isn't!

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.880
Battledrone General's effect activates!

00:03:55.890 --> 00:04:03.860
Once per turn, my Level 4 or below Drone 
with 1000 or fewer ATK can attack you directly!

00:04:04.490 --> 00:04:06.590
Go, Drone Pawn!

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:13.970
General's additional effect activates!

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:17.600
When a Drone deals you direct damage...

00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:22.240
...I can tribute it to deal 
you damage equal to its ATK!

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:26.770
Sergeant's effect activates!

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:33.150
Since Drone Pawn dealt you direct damage, 
this card can attack you directly!

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:45.360
Due to General's effect, by tributing 
Sergeant, you take damage equal to its ATK!

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.440
We're instantly down to 500 LP.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.210
Next, let's battle.

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:59.750
General attacks Clock Wyvern!

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:04.380
If we take this attack, it's over!

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:08.120
I activate the trap, Cure Conversion!

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:12.860
I tribute the monster that's 
being attacked to end the battle!

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:16.480
Then I draw one card.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:21.340
If it's a monster, I regain 
LP equal to its ATK!

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.110
I drew Cyberse Wizard!

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:28.370
We regain 1800 LP!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.690
You missed your target.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:33.260
You too.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.080
Huh?

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.620
Now you can't activate your Skill next turn.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:39.820
You knew that?

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:42.150
I end my turn.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:45.970
Playmaker, only two turns until your end.

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.560
The count's two.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:49.030
My turn!

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:49.990
One!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.360
I draw!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:56.530
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Cyberse Bridge!

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.540
By sending a Cyberse in my 
hand to the graveyard...

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:04.780
...I move my monster from the Extra 
Monster Zone to the Main Monster Zone.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:10.980
I send Cyberse Wizard to the graveyard 
to move Shootingcode Talker!

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.820
Then I draw one card.

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:19.190
If it's a monster, I can Special Summon a 
Cyberse with the same Level from my graveyard!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:24.130
But if I don't draw a monster 
card, it's sent to the graveyard.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.590
Level 4 Bitrooper!

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:30.760
So I Special Summon Clock 
Wyvern from my graveyard!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:34.510
Clock Wyvern's effect activates!

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:38.440
By halving its ATK, it Special 
Summons a Clock Token.

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:44.650
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:51.320
I set Clock Wyvern and Clock 
Token in the Link Markers!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.090
Link Summon!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:57.600
Appear, Link 2 Cyberse Witch!

00:06:58.110 --> 00:07:01.070
Then I activate Bitrooper's 
effect from my hand!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:05.750
By discarding Level 1 Trash Hacker, 
Bitrooper Special Summons itself!

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:09.770
It's pointless to Link Summon again.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:14.980
As long as Capture Drone is on the 
field, Link Monsters can't attack!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.380
Cyberse Witch's effect activates!

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:24.200
When a monster is Special Summoned next to its 
link, by banishing a spell from my graveyard...

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:30.100
...I add a Cyberse Ritual Monster and 
Cynet Ritual in my deck to my hand!

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:32.880
A Ritual...

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:38.340
Then I Special Summon a Level 4 or 
lower Cyberse from my graveyard!

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:40.810
I Special Summon Cyberse Wizard!

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:51.470
From my hand, I activate the 
Ritual Spell, Cynet Ritual!

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:56.520
I tribute monsters from my hand and field whose total

00:07:56.520 --> 00:08:01.170
Level is at least equal to the Ritual Monster's Level!

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:05.720
I Ritual Summon a Cyberse 
Ritual Monster from my hand!

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:11.740
I tribute Level 4 Cyberse 
Wizard and Bitrooper!

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:14.490
The contract has been made.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:19.480
The sage who wields dark power 
inherits these two souls!

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.380
Ritual Summon!

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:25.720
Rise, Cyberse Magician!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:31.420
Capture Drone doesn't affect Ritual Monsters!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.160
I set one card.

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:35.630
Let's battle!

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:39.760
Cyberse Magician attacks Battledrone General!

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:48.780
When a Cyberse attacks, I can banish Trash 
Hacker from the graveyard to activate its effect!

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:52.550
Battledrone General's effects are negated!

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:57.580
General isn't destroyed this 
turn, but damage is doubled!

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:05.550
When Cyberse Magician battles a 
Link Monster, it gains 1000 ATK!

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:14.060
Combined with Trash Hacker's 
effect, you take 2200 damage!

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:17.340
I activate the trap card, Demolition Drone!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:24.310
By tribute my Drone, I take 
half damage this turn.

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:27.310
I tribute General.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:30.780
So Drone Launcher Unit is also destroyed.

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:33.420
Seriously?  He got rid of his general!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:38.260
An excellent superior officer is 
willing to retreat courageously.

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:42.730
Due to Demolition Drone's 
effect, damage is halved!

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:45.700
Cyberse Magic!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:57.800
He lowered the damage from 2500 to 1250, 
but was it worth throwing away his general?

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.780
I end my turn.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:13.180
I'll now end this.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:16.600
Two.  The final count.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.770
My turn.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:25.470
I draw.

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:28.200
Capture Drone's effect.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:31.160
I Special Summon three Drone Tokens.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:35.650
Come out!  The circuit that leads to victory!

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:40.330
I set one Drone Token in the Link Marker!

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.090
Link Summon.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:46.660
Link 1 Battledrone Sergeant!

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:52.030
Come out again!  The circuit 
that leads to victory!

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:56.960
I set two Drone Tokens in the Link Markers!

00:10:57.890 --> 00:10:59.380
Link Summon.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.620
Link 2 Medicdrone Dock!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:08.560
From my hand, I activate the 
Equip Spell, Assemble Drone!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:13.790
I Special Summon a Drone Link Monster from 
the graveyard and equip it with this card!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.790
Come, Battledrone General!

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:23.130
The monster equipped with 
Assemble Drone gains 500 ATK.

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:27.710
The general looks incredible.

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.670
General's effect activates!

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:35.640
Once per turn, a Drone in the graveyard 
is Special Summoned next to its link.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:38.880
Come, Drone Pawn!

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:45.350
When Drone Pawn is on the field, General 
equipped with Assemble Drone can't attack.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.600
The general isn't acting yet.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:53.590
But due to General's effect, 
Pawn can attack directly.

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:56.060
I set one card.

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.510
I activate General's effect!

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.300
Drone Pawn attacks you directly!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.640
Cyberse Magician's effect!

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.270
Damage is halved!

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:15.250
Due to General's effect, by tributing 
the Pawn that attacked...

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:17.720
...you take damage equal to its ATK.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:24.690
Cyberse Magician's effect!  
Cyberse Architect!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.860
Next is Sergeant's effect!

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:38.660
When a Drone deals direct damage, this 
card can also attack you directly!

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:43.570
Due to Cyberse Magician's 
effect, damage is halved!

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:51.480
General's effect!

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:55.950
By tributing Sergeant, you 
take damage equal to its ATK!

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.160
Once more!

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.630
This is the end.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:07.100
I activate my Skill, Drone Craft Force!

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:11.400
Once per duel, your monster loses 200 ATK for

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:16.960
every Drone in the graveyard until the end of the turn!

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:20.180
The graveyard has one... two...

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.280
Five!

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:23.510
Down 1000?

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:30.800
And that amount is added to General's ATK!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:36.690
Since I tributed Drone 
Pawn, General can attack.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:39.460
Go!  Attack Cyberse Magician!

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.960
Cyberse Magician's effect!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:47.330
When it battles a Link 
Monster, it gains 1000 ATK!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:50.160
But that's not enough.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:52.880
Perish, Cyberse Magician!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.950
Cyberse Architect!

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:03.090
We're barely safe!

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.500
I'm not done!

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:07.830
Medicdrone Dock attacks Cyberse Witch!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.660
If this works, we'll have 0 LP!

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:14.300
I activate the trap card, 
Excess Lesser Linker!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:20.470
When a Link 2 or lower Link Monster 
battles, its ATK become the same as yours!

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:27.380
They destroyed each other!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:33.390
You're the first to ever escape 
my count during a duel.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.700
You should feel proud.

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:37.880
Medicdrone Dock's effect!

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:43.200
When this card is destroyed, 
we both regain 1000 LP.

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:46.860
Playmaker, regain your LP!

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:48.380
No no no, no need.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:52.140
Far too kind.  Don't worry about us!

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:55.840
He stopped us from using our Skill.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:15:00.580
Playmaker, give up and hand over the Ignis.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.620
Stop joking!

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:07.320
We're tied together by 
a strong trust and bond!

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:10.290
Bond with an AI?

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:14.800
Happy birthday, Mom.

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:16.060
Thank you.

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:28.900
Kengo, won't you reconsider college?

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:31.490
No need for that.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:36.880
Without Dad around, I'm grateful that you 
still let me graduate from high school.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:41.350
So I want to work so that 
you can take it easy.

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.550
Kengo...

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.970
Is this safe?  There's no driver.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:53.700
Don't be silly.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:56.850
This taxi is loaded with the latest AI.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:16:00.000
City Area 1825 TX.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.970
Understood.

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.250
Incredible, right?

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:14.980
This AI system selects the most 
precise, shortest and safest route.

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.120
It is incredible.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:21.860
We'll celebrate your birthday at 
that sky restaurant next year.

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:23.940
You're getting ahead of yourself.

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:26.300
Huh?  An accident?

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:29.300
Avoiding accident.  Changing route.

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:32.250
Hey!  What's wrong?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.450
Damn!  Duck, Mom!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:45.850
Mom!  Mom!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:54.820
Your mother's spinal cord is greatly damaged.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.540
She'll never stand again.

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:01.300
And your right arm...

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.840
Is that him?

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:23.490
Yes.  Even in the cyber division, he's 
famous for making AI surrender using that right arm.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:27.780
Your AI should be under human control!

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:32.830
Your remaining LP won't let 
you activate your Skill.

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:34.130
I end my turn!

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:35.980
My turn!

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:39.140
This draw will determine everything.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:40.510
I draw!

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:44.210
You're in a hopeless situation.

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:46.250
You can't win.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.980
Are you sure?

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:53.220
From my hand, I activate the 
Continuous Spell, Dimension Link!

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:58.300
I pay half my LP to banish 
a Link Monster on my field!

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:04.760
The Link Monster is Shootingcode Talker!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:12.240
Capture Drone's target was 
banished, so it's destroyed.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:15.730
Now the Link Monster's chains are gone!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.210
We can activate our Skill!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:21.080
I activate the Continuous Trap. Drone Cordon!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:25.880
Your card effects can't target my Drones!

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:28.720
And your Link Monsters can't attack!

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:31.720
What?  We can't attack again?

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:32.990
I still have my Skill!

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.650
Come, Data Storm!

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:41.000
Seize the wind, Playmaker!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:45.400
I activate my Skill!  Storm Access!

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:53.640
I activate the Ritual Spell, Cynet 
Ritual's effect from my graveyard!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:56.080
When there are no monsters on my field...

00:18:56.080 --> 00:19:02.520
...I banish this card and a Ritual Monster 
to Special Summon two Cynet Tokens!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:06.090
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:10.430
The summoning conditions are two Cyberses!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.400
Link Summon!

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:16.350
Appear, Link 2 Clock Spartoi!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:23.140
When it's Link Summoned, I add 
Cynet Fusion in my deck to my hand!

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:28.260
Next, I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Dimension Link's effect!

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:30.260
I send it to the graveyard to Special Summon the

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:34.110
banished Shootingcode Talker next to Clock Spartoi's link...

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:40.590
...by raising its ATK by 600 
and negating its effects!

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:43.560
Yeah!  Now it has the 
same ATK as the general!

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:47.300
But due to Drone Cordon's 
effect, you can't attack.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.770
Clock Spartoi's effect activates!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:53.200
I negate my graveyard's Level 4 or lower Cyberse's

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:57.480
effects to Special Summon it next to this card's link!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.960
Come, Clock Wyvern!

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:03.710
I'll finish you with this!

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.420
That's...

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:09.140
I activate the spell card, Cynet Fusion!

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:15.390
I send Fusion Material from my hand and 
field to the graveyard to summon a Fusion Monster!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:22.870
I fuse Clock Wyvern, Shootingcode 
Talker and Clock Spartoi!

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:24.320
Fusion!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:26.570
You!  Go!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:31.280
The strong ones gather 
before its grand wings!

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:33.780
Become a new legend!

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:35.340
Fusion Summon!

